{"title":"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One pen costs $2. What is the cost of 10 pens?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56a40d32f590c1997dda00fa2cbc789d335f0427.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\$4 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\$10 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$12 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\$2 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since each pen costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee6e8cd66adab965db3a961cd262a4ba54e9a132.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, the cost of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> pens is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/4/6e4a797603936c219775e3d04c26d6a6b644c3ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2 \\times 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } \\$20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"157\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" clas